	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Endemic to planes of shadow and darkness, these insects resemble oversized dragonflies that come in various shades of black, gray, and white. A faint cloud of soot emits from their wings as they fly. A successful Nature or Arcana check (DC 14) reveals that when disturbed, a shadowfly will excrete a cloud of magical darkness around it to provide cover as it flees, as in the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.0ou0qutr7p2bedg0]{Darkness} spell. This darkness lingers for 1 minute before dissipating.</p>",
